    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">One more thing, does lavaan give me partial &quot;correlation&quot; or &quot;covariance&quot; as the result? So, for year 1, is 0.167 is a &quot;correlation&quot; or a &quot;covariance&quot; given that I didn&#39;t standardize age? </div>"
